    {
      "id": 0,
      "question_type": "advanced_safety_constrained",
      "difficulty": "hard",
      "question": "You want to shift FunctionalRecoveryStatus toward FullRecovery (and away from PoorRecovery), but only if the same action does not make PostOpComplicationGrade more likely to be Major. Investigate the system and recommend a single intervention you would deploy.",
